  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hello, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065006C006C006F002C00200010000201000000002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>? So you’re\nIvor-sensei’s<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nrival!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000010000201000000003F00200053006F00200079006F0075201900720065000A00490076006F0072002D00730065006E0073006500692019007300100001BE00000A0072006900760061006C002100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ve heard a great deal about you.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065201900760065002000680065006100720064002000610020006700720065006100740020006400650061006C002000610062006F0075007400200079006F0075002E00100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I am Lence—a devotee of the Pokémon known as\nThroh. Pleased to meet you.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmph! Sneaking in with your own introduction\nwhen I was speaking to h<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂimer first, are you?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJust the sort of underhanded move I’d expect\nfrom a Throh fan!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 165
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I am Freppe, eternal follower of the Pokémon\ncalled Sawk!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200061006D0020004600720065007000700065002C00200065007400650072006E0061006C00200066006F006C006C006F0077006500720020006F0066002000740068006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A00630061006C006C006500640020005300610077006B002100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>You’ve caught us at an interesting moment,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nLet<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nme<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nexplain.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 15,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "These two are fervent fans of Sawk and Throh,\nrespectively.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500730065002000740077006F0020006100720065002000660065007200760065006E0074002000660061006E00730020006F00660020005300610077006B00200061006E00640020005400680072006F0068002C000A0072006500730070006500630074006900760065006C0079002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Each believes their Pokémon is stronger, and they\nwish to settle the matter with a team competition.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>\nI have a team of four Throh, but I need a fifth.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWould you round out our ranks with your own\nThroh, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nYou<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncould<U+0010><U+0001>븀\neven<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nbe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncaptain<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfor<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nfinal match!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 26,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 189
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There you go again, stealing my thunder! Typical\nsneaky Throh fan!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650072006500200079006F007500200067006F00200061006700610069006E002C00200073007400650061006C0069006E00670020006D00790020007400680075006E00640065007200210020005400790070006900630061006C000A0073006E00650061006B00790020005400680072006F0068002000660061006E002100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve been looking for a fifth Sawk, too!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019007600650020006200650065006E0020006C006F006F006B0069006E006700200066006F0072002000610020006600690066007400680020005300610077006B002C00200074006F006F002100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please, both of you—calm down.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002C00200062006F007400680020006F006600200079006F0075201400630061006C006D00200064006F0077006E002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How about it, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nDo you feel moved to support one of these two?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F0077002000610062006F00750074002000690074002C00200010000201000000003F00100001BE01000A0044006F00200079006F00750020006600650065006C0020006D006F00760065006400200074006F00200073007500700070006F007200740020006F006E00650020006F0066002000740068006500730065002000740077006F003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Please lend your might to the Sawk Squad,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000050006C00650061007300650020006C0065006E006400200079006F007500720020006D006900670068007400200074006F00200074006800650020005300610077006B002000530071007500610064002C000A0010000201000000002100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Give your support to the Throh Throng,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000004700690076006500200079006F0075007200200073007500700070006F0072007400200074006F00200074006800650020005400680072006F00680020005400680072006F006E0067002C000A0010000201000000002100100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "To pick a team, come and talk to me with only a\nsingle Sawk or a single Throh in your party.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see you’ve brought a Sawk. Does that mean\nyou’ll join the Sawk Squad?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I see you’ve brought a Throh. Does that mean\nyou’ll join the Throh Throng?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes, put me in!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005900650073002C00200070007500740020006D006500200069006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hang on...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061006E00670020006F006E002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Indeed! Think carefully about which side to join.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006E006400650065006400210020005400680069006E006B0020006300610072006500660075006C006C0079002000610062006F007500740020007700680069006300680020007300690064006500200074006F0020006A006F0069006E002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Congratulations on growing the ranks of the\nSawk Squad, Freppe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006E00670072006100740075006C006100740069006F006E00730020006F006E002000670072006F00770069006E00670020007400680065002000720061006E006B00730020006F00660020007400680065000A005300610077006B002000530071007500610064002C0020004600720065007000700065002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our victory is certain!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0075007200200076006900630074006F007200790020006900730020006300650072007400610069006E002100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Congratulations on growing the ranks of the\nThroh Throng, Lence.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F006E00670072006100740075006C006100740069006F006E00730020006F006E002000670072006F00770069006E00670020007400680065002000720061006E006B00730020006F00660020007400680065000A005400680072006F00680020005400680072006F006E0067002C0020004C0065006E00630065002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for choosing the Throh Throng! I’m\ndeeply honored to have you!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now then, it’s time for our competition to\ncommence.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00770020007400680065006E002C00200069007420190073002000740069006D006500200066006F00720020006F0075007200200063006F006D007000650074006900740069006F006E00200074006F000A0063006F006D006D0065006E00630065002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allow me the honor of serving as witness and\nreferee!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C006F00770020006D0065002000740068006500200068006F006E006F00720020006F0066002000730065007200760069006E00670020006100730020007700690074006E00650073007300200061006E0064000A0072006500660065007200650065002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s make sure we all know the rules.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe’ll have five matches, with the team captains\nsteering the final one. The team with more wins<U+0010><U+0001>븀\noverall will be the victors of this competition.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 194
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Now begin!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007700200062006500670069006E002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our first contenders: Sawk of the Swift Wind and\nThroh of the Fleet Foot!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ippon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900700070006F006E002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sawk of the Swift Wind wins!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300610077006B0020006F00660020007400680065002000530077006900660074002000570069006E0064002000770069006E0073002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our second match: Sawk of the Roiling Waves\nversus Throh the Ardent!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F007500720020007300650063006F006E00640020006D0061007400630068003A0020005300610077006B0020006F0066002000740068006500200052006F0069006C0069006E0067002000570061007600650073000A0076006500720073007500730020005400680072006F0068002000740068006500200041007200640065006E0074002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Two waza-ari!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540077006F002000770061007A0061002D006100720069002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Throh the Ardent is victorious!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680072006F0068002000740068006500200041007200640065006E007400200069007300200076006900630074006F00720069006F00750073002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Match number three: Sawk the Immovable versus\nThroh of the Leg Technique!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Waza-ari!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570061007A0061002D006100720069002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The match goes to Throh of the Leg Technique!\nThe Throh Throng leads with two wins to one.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Our fourth match pits Sawk of the Brutal Strike\nagainst Throh of the Artful Footwork!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5596,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ippon!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900700070006F006E002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sawk of the Brutal Strike claims the match! We’re\ntied at two wins each.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It is time we settle this. Team captains, take your\nplaces with your Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is it—our final match. Sawk the Last-Minute\nEntrant versus Throh the Red Demon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is it—our final match. Sawk the Blue Demon\nversus Throh the Last-Minute Entrant.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Fight!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460069006700680074002100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
