      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 7332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200064006900640020006900740021002000540068006900730020006900730020006100200076006900630074006F0072007900200066006F007200200061006C006C0020005400680072006F0068002100100002011401C90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You fought admirably. Throh’s throws are, as\nalways, masterful.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 7432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200066006F0075006700680074002000610064006D0069007200610062006C0079002E0020005400680072006F0068201900730020007400680072006F007700730020006100720065002C002000610073000A0061006C0077006100790073002C0020006D0061007300740065007200660075006C002E00100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you—but we couldn’t have won without\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>’s help.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nReally, our competition has given me a new\nadmiration for Sawk. I hope you’ll teach me more<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nabout what makes it so great!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 7568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 188
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Celebrating your opponent even in defeat is very\ngood sportsmanship!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWe have embodied the true spirit of martial arts\nhere today. Thank you for your aid,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 7944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 174
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The Sawk Squad’s next objective will be to get\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> as a full member!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǈ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 8292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650020005300610077006B002000530071007500610064201900730020006E0065007800740020006F0062006A006500630074006900760065002000770069006C006C00200062006500200074006F0020006700650074000A001000020100000000200061007300200061002000660075006C006C0020006D0065006D006200650072002100100002011401C80000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
